1
00:00:00,475 --> 00:00:02,435
(Penny:)What do you want me to tell you,
Sheldon?

2
00:00:02,936 --> 00:00:06,436
l want you to tell me
that Howard is being mean to me for no reason.

3
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:09,730
(Penny:)Fine. Howard is being mean to you
for no reason.

4
00:00:10,235 --> 00:00:11,405
l knew it.

5
00:00:16,741 --> 00:00:19,241
- What's the matter?
- Every time I spend the night...

6
00:00:19,411 --> 00:00:23,251
(Bernadette:)...your mom slaps me on the behind
and says, "Go get'em."

7
00:00:24,290 --> 00:00:28,340
It's not her fauIt.
She's getting hormone-replacement therapy.

8
00:00:30,797 --> 00:00:33,387
(Howard:)Makes her crazy horny.

9
00:00:34,801 --> 00:00:38,301
(Howard:)Check this out. I got Sheldon
to wear the French maid's costume.

10
00:00:38,471 --> 00:00:40,391
(Bernadette:)My God, that's terrible.

11
00:00:40,557 --> 00:00:43,437
What?
Hey, I gave you first crack at it.

12
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:46,600
(Bernadette:)Why are you doing that?
You're being mean to him.

13
00:00:46,771 --> 00:00:48,021
He's mean all the time.

14
00:00:48,189 --> 00:00:51,029
(Howard:)You've heard him tease me
about not having a doctorate.

15
00:00:51,192 --> 00:00:54,652
You don't wanna get teased about that,
get a doctorate.

16
00:00:56,406 --> 00:01:00,026
l have one. They're great.

